* CABSRT07 - SORT AND SUMMARISE THE BILLING SUMMARY FILE
* SORTS AND SUMS TELCABS.CABS.SUMMARY BY OCN/BAN/JURISDICTION
* AHEAD OF CABRAT09.  THE SUM FIELDS COLLAPSE MULTIPLE RATED
* ELEMENTS FOR THE SAME BAN/JURISDICTION INTO ONE SUMMARY LINE.
*
* MODS=(E35=(CABSE35B,4096)) APPLIES THE RT-ROUND-RULE ROUNDING
* AT SORT TIME, AFTER THE SUM, ON THE SUMMED AMOUNT FIELD.
* NO CABRAT PROGRAM APPLIES ROUNDING TO THE SUMMARY-LEVEL
* AMOUNT - CABRAT09 ONLY ACCUMULATES WHAT THIS EXIT HANDS
* BACK.  A REVIEWER READING CABRAT09 ALONE WILL CONCLUDE THE
* SUMMARY IS UNROUNDED.  IT IS NOT.
 SORT FIELDS=(5,4,CH,A,9,13,CH,A,40,1,CH,A)
 SUM FIELDS=(160,7,PD)
 MODS=(E35=(CABSE35B,4096))
 OPTION EQUALS
 RECORD TYPE=F,LENGTH=200
